      <titleblock next-project="hs-objects">Neon Wave</titleblock>

      <block layout="text-right">
        <text>
          <p>The "Neon Wave" is a rather weird contraption that was used in our 2026 stage production (amateur theater group Quasi playing "Not just Freaky",
            written and directed by Tanja&#160;Mensink, March/April 2026)</p>
          <p>It features: a flip-up screen displaying text, a robotic arm that examines the audience's faces and then sprays a mood-matching scent
            into the crowd. Everything is, of course, fake and supposedly AI-driven.</p>
          <p>In the same play, another device of me was used: <a href="freaky-stage.html">the Freaky stage</a>.</p>
        </text>
